WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.041 --> 00:00:04.096
Beauty ran for the forest.

2
00:00:04.097 --> 00:00:06.158
Thunder boomed.

3
00:00:06.159 --> 00:00:08.886
Lightning split the sky.

4
00:00:08.887 --> 00:00:12.702
Under Beauty's feet, the ground turned to mud.

5
00:00:12.703 --> 00:00:16.285
She slipped and slid.

6
00:00:16.286 --> 00:00:20.020
Beast's roars echoed behind her.

7
00:00:20.021 --> 00:00:24.320
"I wish Deer was here to help me!" she thought.

8
00:00:24.321 --> 00:00:28.054
"This way!" a man suddenly yelled.

9
00:00:28.055 --> 00:00:33.245
"Oh no!" Beauty thought. "Beast has guards.

10
00:00:33.246 --> 00:00:38.108
They're after me!"

11
00:00:38.109 --> 00:00:42.537
She ran under a tall tree.

12
00:00:42.538 --> 00:00:44.959
The voices came closer.

13
00:00:44.960 --> 00:00:47.513
They sounded angry.

14
00:00:47.514 --> 00:00:49.960
Beauty shivered.

15
00:00:49.961 --> 00:00:53.406
Then another bolt of lightning flashed.

16
00:00:53.407 --> 00:00:56.428
A branch fell off a tree.

17
00:00:56.429 --> 00:01:00.858
Crash! It knocked Beauty down.

18
00:01:00.859 --> 00:01:05.067
"Ow." Beauty moaned in pain.

19
00:01:05.068 --> 00:01:07.457
She tried to get up.

20
00:01:07.458 --> 00:01:10.845
But the tree branch lay on top of her.

21
00:01:10.846 --> 00:01:13.602
The voices were getting closer.

22
00:01:13.603 --> 00:01:17.834
"This way!" the men shouted.

23
00:01:17.835 --> 00:01:21.302
Suddenly Beast was standing over her.

24
00:01:21.303 --> 00:01:24.950
He roared loudly and beat his chest.

25
00:01:24.951 --> 00:01:27.069
Beauty trembled.

26
00:01:27.070 --> 00:01:31.780
"Please," she begged. "Don't hurt me. I

27
00:01:31.781 --> 00:01:34.840
didn't mean to do anything wrong!" Beast

28
00:01:34.841 --> 00:01:37.727
leaned in close. Beauty

29
00:01:37.728 --> 00:01:41.137
could feel his breath on her face. She

30
00:01:41.138 --> 00:01:43.718
squeezed her eyes shut. "I

31
00:01:43.719 --> 00:01:47.307
love you, Father!" she thought. Then—

32
00:01:47.308 --> 00:01:49.661
whoosh!

33
00:01:49.662 --> 00:01:54.638
Beauty felt the weight being lifted from her leg.

34
00:01:54.639 --> 00:01:57.722
She looked up.

35
00:01:57.723 --> 00:02:01.384
Beast's green eyes were staring into hers.

36
00:02:01.385 --> 00:02:06.975
"You're helping me," she whispered. "Why are . . ."

37
00:02:06.976 --> 00:02:11.145
"Of course I'm helping you," Beast said.

38
00:02:11.146 --> 00:02:16.011
Whizz! Arrows shot through the air.

39
00:02:16.012 --> 00:02:19.221
Beast fell to the ground.

40
00:02:19.222 --> 00:02:21.806
His leg was bleeding.

41
00:02:21.807 --> 00:02:24.454
He roared in anger.

42
00:02:24.455 --> 00:02:26.969
Beauty gasped.

43
00:02:26.970 --> 00:02:30.730
"The hunters are after Beast!" she thought.

44
00:02:30.731 --> 00:02:35.531
"Get up, Beast!" She helped him to his feet.

45
00:02:35.532 --> 00:02:40.738
"Those men want to kill you."

46
00:02:40.739 --> 00:02:46.445
"Go home to your father," Beast snapped.

47
00:02:46.446 --> 00:02:50.063
"No . . . ," Beauty tried to say.

48
00:02:50.064 --> 00:02:53.146
Beast's ring glowed brightly.

49
00:02:53.147 --> 00:02:57.945
Poof! Everything went black.

